      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__sl__bt__test_1ga7f995817c8e2ec75377cc17e4e1ff233" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>sl_status_t</type>
        <definition>sl_status_t sl_bt_test_dtm_end</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>sl_bt_test_dtm_end</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>End a transmitter or a receiver test. When the command is processed by the radio and the test has ended, a <ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__test__dtm__completed" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_test_dtm_completed</ref> event is triggered.</para>
