<listitem><para><ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__test__dtm__completed" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_test_dtm_completed</ref> - Received when the command is processed by the radio and the test has ended. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
